  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Slavery Footprint</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">J/TIP will continue to support the Fair Trade Fund to enhance the capabilities of Slavery Footprint with a focus on expanding its social media strategy and bettering incentives for consumers to reduce their footprints. Slavery Footprint is an online tool and mobile application that measures an individuals slavery &quot;footprint&quot; based on his or her purchasing habits, as compared to his/her consumption of source commodities that are produced with forced labor according to public available reports published by the government and international organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
